{"1148130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Divinum", "steam_appid": 1148130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.poster.avif?t=1788216413\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.webm?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.mp4?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An outside threat reaches your homeland, a quiet northern island. You play as Fjør, a young warrior among those born under the Fate of the Guardian, blessed with exceptional combat prowess. But that alone is not enough to defeat the invaders and  protect what's sacred to your people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking the path of a Warden, explore the island above and below the surface: forgotten caves and ominous forests, gloomy catacombs and sacred ruins, where you shall fight hordes of monsters, discover well-hidden secrets and harness ancestral legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intricate Combat System </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.poster.avif?t=1788216413\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.webm?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.mp4?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the best of the hack-and-slash genre, Divinum has a wide range of options to master and experiment with. Launch enemies into the air, where they are unable to act or escape while Fjør gains access to unique moves. Unleash unstoppable combos with two distinct primary weapons and special skills. Leave your foes no chance with quick dodges, blocks, and parries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Impactful Collectible Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.poster.avif?t=1788216413\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.webm?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.mp4?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world, look for secrets and fight bosses to find Runes that meaningfully change how you fight. A +5% damage item? You won't find anything this boring in Divinum. Runes can provide anything from solid unique bonuses to modifiers that can completely change how you approach battles <strong>— </strong>but great power often comes with trade-offs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Test Your Skills and Be Rewarded</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.poster.avif?t=1788216413\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.webm?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.mp4?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the island, dangerous trials and ancient evil await you. Conquer them all and claim generous rewards!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.poster.avif?t=1788216413\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.webm?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/532b72f9a99c449544c9a317c4a879c0.mp4?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An outside threat reaches your homeland, a quiet northern island. You play as Fjør, a young warrior among those born under the Fate of the Guardian, blessed with exceptional combat prowess. But that alone is not enough to defeat the invaders and  protect what's sacred to your people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking the path of a Warden, explore the island above and below the surface: forgotten caves and ominous forests, gloomy catacombs and sacred ruins, where you shall fight hordes of monsters, discover well-hidden secrets and harness ancestral legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intricate Combat System </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.poster.avif?t=1788216413\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.webm?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/fb17ee810defbeb896c4d8f4e9dac019.mp4?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the best of the hack-and-slash genre, Divinum has a wide range of options to master and experiment with. Launch enemies into the air, where they are unable to act or escape while Fjør gains access to unique moves. Unleash unstoppable combos with two distinct primary weapons and special skills. Leave your foes no chance with quick dodges, blocks, and parries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Impactful Collectible Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.poster.avif?t=1788216413\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.webm?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/5b2d036756eb3c9fb9d08077fe58286f.mp4?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world, look for secrets and fight bosses to find Runes that meaningfully change how you fight. A +5% damage item? You won't find anything this boring in Divinum. Runes can provide anything from solid unique bonuses to modifiers that can completely change how you approach battles <strong>— </strong>but great power often comes with trade-offs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Test Your Skills and Be Rewarded</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.poster.avif?t=1788216413\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.webm?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/extras/426c5f5fea36bbf425fb3b83a4c87410.mp4?t=1788216413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the island, dangerous trials and ancient evil await you. Conquer them all and claim generous rewards!</p>", "short_description": "Divinum is an action-adventure that blends stylish, expressive combat with rewarding exploration. Master devastating combos and craft unique builds to repel mysterious invaders and uncover your island's hidden truth.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, French, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/d83df4c3d12fb4874759e3bd5c6db1c5cdb7eaf8/header.jpg?t=1788216413", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/8600d51953a9f23a61e54a642ecf8f947c6c73d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788216413", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1148130/8600d51953a9f23a61e54a642ecf8f947c6c73d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17882